  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AFRICAN UNION SUPPORT PROGRAMME (AUSP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">For over a decade, NORCAP and the AU has worked in partnership to strengthen the capacity of the continental organisation. Through deployments of strategic expertise, the AU is enabled to reach its prioritised goals of peace, prosperity, and integration. The NORCAP AU Programme with the FCDO supports the African Union Commission to further their work towards the Agenda 2063 (an overarching set of goals for the continent to reach by 2063). The funding from FCDO is specifically towards supporting the Political Affairs, Peace and Security Department in conflict management, mediation, and governance, as well as the Department of Economic Development, Trade, Tourism, Industry and Minerals with tax and internal revenue mobilisation.</narrative>
  </description>
